1. GRANT OF LICENSE
This grant applies from the original release date of uvcpipe v0.2.0 to all
official copies of that version, including previously downloaded archives
and the MCP bundle. It supersedes the Free Core and Commercial Pro feature
lists in the Version 1.0 agreement included with those copies.

(a) Free Core Tier. You may use device probing (probe), local HDMI frame
    capture from a USB UVC device or simulation (capture), and the
    localhost MJPEG viewer (view) without a license key. This tier also
    includes --describe, --help, --version, emergency HID release
    (release-all / restore), and --dry-run HID packet previews. You may
    use these read-only, dry-run and emergency-release functions through
    the stdio MCP server (mcp) without a key.
(b) Commercial Pro Tier. A one-time USD $19 Pro license with a valid
    license.json permits live CH9329 keyboard and mouse input through
    the optional supported hardware (key, type and mouse), including
    those input commands through MCP with dry_run set to false.

Open-source builds compiled with -DOSS_EDITION unlock all capabilities offline.

